{
  "name": "schemaform_daisyui",
  "description": "schemaform-dioxus renderers for daisyUI: format-aware inputs, native checkboxes that show a missing or null boolean as indeterminate, native selects for choices, multiple-choice checkbox groups and constant output inside Field parts; a mode-aware submit button with host-classable buttons; error or advisory finding presentation; and the seam the radio, compound select and collection add-ons extend.",
